# Keep Docker build contexts lean and reproducible.
**/node_modules
node_modules
.git
.github
.squad
.copilot
**/dist
shared/dist
packages/*/dist
# tsc -b incremental state: if a stale copy leaks into the build context, tsc
# treats the project as already-built and skips emitting dist/, producing an
# image whose workspace packages have no compiled output. Never ship it.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/data
data
*.log
.DS_Store
packages/e2e/test-results
packages/e2e/playwright-report
e2e-results
